      "content": "hey, my husband had the flu last week and seems to be getting better but he woke up today with a really high fever (like 103) and a bad headache. he's also acting a bit weird, kind of slow and confused when he talks to me. i'm thinking it's just the flu lingering or the fever making him spacey. should i just give him more ibuprofen and keep an eye on him or do i need to take him in?",
